              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Correct. Graph [A] vs. time and determine the slope of the tangent line at t = 25.0 s. This is the instantaneous rate of change of [A]. From the definition of reaction rate and the reaction stoichiometry, the instantaneous rate for the reaction = "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "189209805",
                        "src": "-\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack\\mathrm A\\rbrack}{2\\;\\mathrm\\Delta t}",
                        "subtype": "latex",
                        "type": "formula_inline"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "ytg53grcqf6b4ly",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "4209662116"
              },
              "id": "119039552",
              "legacyMatch": "[0.005,0.008]",
              "rule": "input = {[0.005,0.008]}",
              "score": 10
            },
            {
              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Incorrect. To find the instantaneous rate of reaction: "
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "7k0rg734dtx6r1x",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "ov9ekasr5qbjn1a",
                                "text": "Carefully plot the [A] vs. t data and fit a smooth curve to the data points. The slope of the curve, which is "
                              },
                              {
                                "children": [
                                  {
                                    "id": "djrzymokxswdyjy",
                                    "text": ""
                                  }
                                ],
                                "id": "5gzopiz349mqec5",
                                "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                                "src": "\\frac{\\triangle\\mathrm [A]}{\\triangle t}",
                                "subtype": "latex",
                                "type": "formula_inline"
                              },
                              {
                                "id": "f5ixccokvi8vvmd",
                                "text": ", at a given time is equal to the instantaneous rate of change of [A]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "1644128802",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "hgfeu3oizx77d6c",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "odltd7ybl0qqfpg",
                                "text": "Carefully estimate the value of the slope at the given time to obtain the instantaneous rate of change of [A]."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "2616337691",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "aa8bpcpw3xbxdoo",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "yzdk4ek14xbt1w2",
                                "text": "Relate the rate of change of [A] to the reaction rate using the definition of reaction rate and the stoichiometric coefficient of the reactant A."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "2910256248",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "f5rk1vxjg3df9cp",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "m57tu4an108jpta",
                                "text": "Solve for the reaction rate using the estimated rate of change of [A]."
